<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none">Your message is important to us, and we appreciate the opportunity to assist you.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none">Our team is currently experiencing a high volume of enquiries, but please rest assured that we are committed to providing you with the best possible service.
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none">We aim to get back to you within 2-3 working days.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none">If you require immediate assistance or have any further questions, please feel free to call us on 0191 4661185.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none">Many Thanks<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none">The UKEM Team<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="text-autospace:none"><span style="font-size:8.5pt;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
