[{"kind": "sent", "timestamp": "2026-09-03 20:23:05.772000+00:00", "message_id": "<74b3b881-cc57-40ef-8f8f-0ba7becce431@mindaptivegroup.com>", "body": "<div>Hey Sara,</div><br><div>I saw that you posted about hiring a Business Development Representative last week. I get it, finding someone who can actually build relationships with prospects is tough.</div><br><div>Anyways, figured I'd reach out because I saw you guys at Matrix mostly help organizations with managed IT, security, and data center solutions. I built an Agent that can find and contact IT directors and operations managers at mid-market companies that need help scaling their infrastructure.&nbsp;</div><br><div>If that sounds interesting let me know and I'll record a 3-min video for you showing how we would do it for Matrix.&nbsp;</div><br><div>PS: If you don't have a need for more IT decision maker contacts right now, let me know and I'll step back.&nbsp;</div><br><div>Kind regards,</div><div><div  fr-original-style="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;">Andrew Juran</div><div fr-original-style="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;">Co-founder @ Mindaptive.ai</div></div>", "from_email": "andrew@mindaptivegroup.com", "to_email": "sgerber@matrixintegration.com", "stats_id": "74b3b881-cc57-40ef-8f8f-0ba7becce431", "cc": ""}, {"kind": "sent", "timestamp": "2026-09-08 20:23:31.435000+00:00", "message_id": "<46eef229-33ba-44d1-bbfb-f649d27188d6@mindaptivegroup.com>", "body": "<div>Hey Sara,</div><br><div>This might sound a bit odd…</div><div>We actually help clients like Matrix book meetings with their target customers, but here’s the twist: we only charge when those meetings happen. No retainers, no catch.</div><br><div>Basically, if we don’t deliver, you don’t pay. feels too good to be true, but it isn’t.</div><br><div>Would you like me to send a short 3-min video showing how we’d do it for Matrix?</div><br><div>PS: If you don't have a need for more IT decision maker contacts right now, let me know and I'll step back.</div><br><div>Best,</div><div><div  fr-original-style="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;">Andrew Juran</div><div fr-original-style="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;">Co-founder @ Mindaptive.ai</div></div>", "from_email": "andrew@mindaptivegroup.com", "to_email": "sgerber@matrixintegration.com", "stats_id": "46eef229-33ba-44d1-bbfb-f649d27188d6", "cc": ""}, {"kind": "sent", "timestamp": "2026-09-11 19:04:51.910000+00:00", "message_id": "<136e6a58-9585-4f99-9426-1287935a8d9f@mindaptivegroup.com>", "body": "<div>Thanks for your time, Sara.&nbsp;I don't want to clog your inbox, so this will be my last email.</div><br><div>My goal was to show how we're helping companies like yours automate client acquisition. If filling the pipeline ever becomes a bigger priority, please feel free to reach out.</div><br><div>Wishing you and the Matrix team all the best.</div><br><div><div  fr-original-style="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;">Andrew Juran</div><div fr-original-style="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;">Co-founder @ Mindaptive.ai</div></div>", "from_email": "andrew@mindaptivegroup.com", "to_email": "sgerber@matrixintegration.com", "stats_id": "136e6a58-9585-4f99-9426-1287935a8d9f", "cc": ""}, {"kind": "reply", "timestamp": "2026-09-11 19:05:00+00:00", "message_id": "<5a78c4f46a6e436995e66d739074a05e@CH7PR04MB9617.namprd04.prod.outlook.com>", "body": "<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns:m="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
